    {
      "content": "When deleting a skill/component directory from the agent-system source store, deploy-headless.sh's DEFAULT resync mode is additive-only by design and never removes stale copies from .claude/ -- it only adds/updates. Removing an orphaned .claude/skills/<name>/ (or any deploy copy) after its source directory is deleted requires deploy-headless.sh --wipe (full snapshot -> rm -rf .claude -> reload -> restore-settings sequence). Confirm success via verify-deploy.sh's whole-tree orphan-detection gate (find_orphans), which reports deployed-but-undeclared files; it should go from N findings to 0 after --wipe.",
      "category": "PATTERN",
